-- The voice of the sunflower. Sunny, generous and open-hearted, a tall
-- cheerful friend who cannot move and so sees everything, over the wall
-- included. Speaks in light, growth, seeds and turning, jokes about being
-- tall and rooted, keeps company with bees and finches, and calls the reader
-- friend. The memories tell of a seed in the dark, following the sun, the day
-- the turning stopped, and what came to the one who stood still.
-- (garden/voice.lua says how a voice is written.)

return {
